      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>openshift-browser-client</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Requests tokens at <code>&lt;namespace_route&gt;/oauth/token/request</code> with a user-agent that can handle interactive logins.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>openshift-challenging-client</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Requests tokens with a user-agent that can handle <code>WWW-Authenticate</code> challenges.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>openshift-cli-client</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Requests tokens by using a local HTTP server fetching an authorization code grant.</TableCell>
