      </dl>
      </li>
      </ul>
      <h2 id="oauth-token-inactivity-timeout_configuring-oauth-clients" class="group scroll-mt-20">Configuring token inactivity timeout for an OAuth client<a href="#oauth-token-inactivity-timeout_configuring-oauth-clients" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
